OL,3,GNEWSAClaims potholes reduced to 'record
OL,4,Alow' questioned
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council's claims that the number of
OL,7,Fpotholes in its area has fallen to a
OL,8,F"record low" have been called into
OL,9,Fquestion.
OL,11,FDerbyshire County Council and some of
OL,12,Fits Reform UK administration recently
OL,13,Freleased statistics, external, saying
OL,14,Fthat in four months, the number of
OL,15,Foutstanding potholes has been cut from
OL,16,F12,000 in April to under 700, "the
OL,17,Flowest figure recorded for more than 12
OL,18,Fmonths".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
