OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAClaims potholes reduced to 'record
OL,4,Alow' questioned
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the 12,000 figure includes both
OL,7,Ftemporary and permanent repairs, and
OL,8,Fsome failed repairs that required teams
OL,9,Fto return.
OL,11,FConservative opposition leader Alex
OL,12,FDale said it was "concerning when some
OL,13,Fof these stats don't even seem to add
OL,14,Fup", though Reform deny any suggestion
OL,15,Fthe figures are a misrepresentation.
